probe shop_crimson_17 3fc00000 "I hate how many people hang around, but none of them buy anything! Caitlin the Nurse makes loads of money, I like deep pockets. I dislike Herbert the Tax Collector, too frugal and doesn't ever buy my things. I hate Grayson the Angler's terrible personality! "
probe shop_crimson_18 3fc00000 "UGH, I hate how unhealthy it is to cram so many people in one place! What? Maurice the Arms Dealer? I don't have a crush! I don't! Shut up! Magius the Wizard is a smart and likeable goof. I don't like Glitter the Party Girl that much, kinda weirds me out. I don't like Faye the Dryad that much, kinda weirds me out. "
probe shop_crimson_19 3fc00000 "Hey, I can't do what I do with so many people watchin' me. Think Caitlin the Nurse ever, ya know, checks me out? Yeah, I like Cynthia the Steampunker, wicked cool person. I don't really like William the Golfer bein' on my turf, ya know? I'd REALLY like to use Jarut the Demolitionist as a range target sometime. "
probe shop_crimson_20 3fc00000 "So many others crammed into one spot? The grass is doomed, I hate it! I like that U'wa the Witch Doctor resonates with every fiber of my being! I like that Shiitake the Truffle resonates with every fiber of my being! I don't like that Grayson the Angler has no respect for other beings. I hate William the Golfer's destructive habits towards nature! "
probe shop_crimson_22 3fc00000 "I hate overcrowding. I prefer the open world! I'm quite fond of Fitz the Clothier, we have a lot in common. Cynthia the Steampunker rubs me the wrong way. Maybe it's the weird clothing? I hate that Luciano the Painter is around. The world is fine the way it was made! I'm quite fond of Astra the Zoologist, we have a lot in common. "
probe shop_crimson_37 3f800000 ""
probe shop_crimson_38 3fc00000 "Too many people around! One mistake making dynamite, and... well, they'd HATE the outcome! Dwarves are naturally drawn to the Underground, it's in our blood! I love how well Barkeep the Tavernkeep can handle a container of fireball! I wanna strap Maurice the Arms Dealer to a rocket and watch what happens! "
probe shop_crimson_54 3fc00000 "Overcrowding is as overcrowding does. Seeing is believing, but sometimes the most likeable things are in the Underground. There's no greater joy than seen through the eyes of Theresa the Princess! Shiitake the Truffle? I hadn't seen anything so delicious in my life. I can't quite place it, but I find Herbert the Tax Collector fascinating. For some reason, being around Caitlin the Nurse makes me feel uneasy. "
probe shop_crimson_107 3f733333 "This crowding triggers bad memories of goblin war camps, I really hate it. Ahh, the Underground is a nice, quiet place to construct more gadgets. Major like-age! Shayna the Mechanic makes my cardiac core function improperly, it appears I love how that feels! Kanmi the Dye Trader understands how fun it is to mix things together, I can respect that! "
probe shop_crimson_108 3fbd70a4 "This overcrowding is starting to dampen my magic! I think. Alfred the Merchant and I share a very long history, I like the mutual wisdom. That loathsome A.N.D.Y. the Cyborg is a complete and total abomination to magic! "
probe shop_crimson_124 3fc00000 "I'm going to need a way bigger power source for THIS MANY people, I hate it! I don't like the Underground, it reminds me of a traumatic experience! Umm... Stazen the Goblin Tinkerer makes my heart flutter, I need to get that checked! I feel like I understand A.N.D.Y. the Cyborg better than anyone else. I don't really like that Maurice the Arms Dealer won't leave me alone! "
probe shop_crimson_142 3fc00000 "This is a pretty big crowd, each and every one on the naughty list. I hate carrying that heavy bag of coal! "
probe shop_crimson_160 3fc00000 "I hate it. So many people... I... I'm not going to get eaten, right? I love Jacob the Guide for being able to talk to me without mysteriously getting hungry. Faye the Dryad treats me with respect, as though I'm a true part of nature. I don't know how to feel about that, except I like it. Fitz the Clothier has tried to eat me so many times. I swear, one time they weren't even human! I, obviously, dislike it. U'wa the Witch Doctor has tried to throw me into a pot filled with other unusual ingredients. I hate that. "
probe shop_crimson_178 3fc00000 "Oi, I absolutely hate crowded quarters! I love how unique and interesting A.N.D.Y. the Cyborg truly is, remarkable! Luciano the Painter is a likeable sort who helps me spruce up my inventions. Glitter the Party Girl is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Magius the Wizard is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Faye the Dryad is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. "
probe shop_crimson_207 3fc00000 "When I'm not doing business, I'd much rather be alone, yes? I hate feeling crammed in! Maurice the Arms Dealer has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Luciano the Painter has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Oh dear, that Cynthia the Steampunker has no sense of color or style, I don't like. I truly, truly hate how unsavory Wet Beard the Pirate can be. "
probe shop_crimson_208 3fc00000 "Wow, there's so many people here, I hate that it's not for a party. Ew, it's so drab in the Underground. How can you party in a place like this? I love that Magius the Wizard always dazzles at my parties. I totally like Iris the Stylist's party style. I think Alfred the Merchant is a killjoy at parties. I hate how Herbert the Tax Collector always tries to shut down my after-parties. What a grump! "
probe shop_crimson_209 3fc00000 "Lifeform limit exceeded. Neural functions overloaded. Translation: I hate this. Iris the Stylist attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Wet Beard the Pirate attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Cynthia the Steampunker attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Magius the Wizard's functions cannot be scientifically analyzed. Neural functions overloaded. Translation: I hate this. "
probe shop_crimson_227 3fc00000 "I hate noisy crowds, when will I get some peace and quiet? I would really love to paint Faye the Dryad... because of the vivid colors, of course! Glitter the Party Girl and I like the same shade of pink! That's a friend, in my book! A.N.D.Y. the Cyborg is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. Shiitake the Truffle is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. "
probe shop_crimson_228 3fc00000 "Too many of your kind are gathering too near, growing much malice in my soul. Faye the Dryad is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. Jacob the Guide is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. I dislike the practices of Caitlin the Nurse. True healing cannot come from metal and glass. Fury fills my being as abominations sprout from tainted earth - I speak of Shiitake the Truffle. "
probe shop_crimson_229 3fc00000 "Ye too hate the feelin' that a mutiny be comin'? Too many scallywags gettin' close to me quarters. Argh, the Underground be a bit cramped for me style, ye scurvy dog! Yarr, Theresa the Princess'd fetch a hefty reward on the seas... jus' kidding, she's me favorite lass. Ahoy, me takes Grayson the Angler under me wing, landlubber. Me love raisin' sea pups! Har Har! Melikes how Barkeep the Tavernkeep brings ye best bottle o' rum. Ye know me don't like that Iris the Stylist tries to cut me beard, I've slit scurvy throats fer less! Me want to make Jacob the Guide walk ye plank, sea dog! Hate the coddlin' and the dastardly smell! "
probe shop_crimson_353 3fc00000 "I absolutely cannot stand having so many people living around me, I can't focus. I can't even touch Theresa the Princess's hair, it's too perfect! Kanmi the Dye Trader is quite the looker... so exotic... I think I'm in love... Wet Beard the Pirate is strong and mysterious. I like that. I tried to work on Barkeep the Tavernkeep, but was rudely rejected, I don't like stubborn people! "
probe shop_crimson_368 3f800000 ""
probe shop_crimson_369 3fc00000 "I hate all these strangers - they scared all my fish half to death! Theresa the Princess is not a fish, yet she doesn't annoy me! That's really cool! Glitter the Party Girl actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! Jarut the Demolitionist actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! Herbert the Tax Collector actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! I hate Barkeep the Tavernkeep, and anyone else who treats me like a child! "
probe shop_crimson_441 3fc00000 "Go tell all these miserable poor freeloaders to scram, I hate crowds. Theresa the Princess shouldn't pay taxes, she's the princess... but she insisted. I highly admire Alfred the Merchant. Anyone who knows the true value of money earns my utmost respect! Exuberant people tend to give me a headache, but somehow I actually like Glitter the Party Girl. I must be losing my mind! Jarut the Demolitionist is just too noisy, away with them and their ilk! "
probe shop_crimson_550 3fc00000 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate overcrowded quarters. Theresa the Princess would make a great ruler where I come from, as well. Jarut the Demolitionist is one crazy little drinker, I love it! I rather dislike Jacob the Guide, they put out similar vibes as some of the dark things from Etheria. "
probe shop_crimson_588 3fbc28f6 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate all the foot traffic here. Tell me something. How am I supposed to golf in a place like the Underground? I tried to teach Theresa the Princess a few slick golf tricks, but she schooled me instead! I like her. It's always fun to hang out with Luciano the Painter. Good people. Unpopular opinion: I quite love having Grayson the Angler around. I get my water hazards returned to me! I dislike being around Wet Beard the Pirate. Makes me feel uneasy. It's always fun to hang out with Astra the Zoologist. Good people. "
probe shop_crimson_633 3f9c28f6 "Eek! I hate feeling worried about what will happen with all these people around! Like, Theresa the Princess has her subjects searching for a way for me to break my fox curse! Yass! I don't like how cruel Grayson the Angler is! I can't explain it. I have like, a thing for U'wa the Witch Doctor. Is it because of the tail? Of course I like William the Golfer! I like, knew them since I was born! "
probe shop_crimson_663 3f400000 "I LOVE being surrounded by others, but I wish not to see them so unhappy with overcrowding. Fitz the Clothier seems so sad sometimes, but he's very nice to me! Barkeep the Tavernkeep is from an entirely different world, that's so interesting! Astra the Zoologist always lets me play with her pets, its so nice! "
state shop_crimson rand 40 0aeca089353e0ccc player 46affc00,45ea6000,00000000,40000000,100,20 npc 27:67b205bf73ce9562 proj 0:cbf29ce484222325
probe shop_jungle_17 3fc00000 "I hate how many people hang around, but none of them buy anything! Hannah the Nurse makes loads of money, I like deep pockets. I dislike McKinly the Tax Collector, too frugal and doesn't ever buy my things. I hate Bart the Angler's terrible personality! "
