probe shop_jungle_19 3fc00000 "Hey, I can't do what I do with so many people watchin' me. Think Hannah the Nurse ever, ya know, checks me out? Yeah, I like Selina the Steampunker, wicked cool person. I don't really like Lion Pines the Golfer bein' on my turf, ya know? I'd REALLY like to use Tordak the Demolitionist as a range target sometime. "
probe shop_jungle_20 3fc00000 "So many others crammed into one spot? The grass is doomed, I hate it! I kissed a tree in the Jungle and I liked it. I like that Konah the Witch Doctor resonates with every fiber of my being! I like that Chanterelle the Truffle resonates with every fiber of my being! I don't like that Bart the Angler has no respect for other beings. I hate Lion Pines the Golfer's destructive habits towards nature! "
probe shop_jungle_22 3fc00000 "I hate overcrowding. I prefer the open world! I don't really like the Ocean. There's little to accomplish. I'm quite fond of Herald the Clothier, we have a lot in common. Selina the Steampunker rubs me the wrong way. Maybe it's the weird clothing? I hate that Guido the Painter is around. The world is fine the way it was made! I'm quite fond of Lizzy the Zoologist, we have a lot in common. "
probe shop_jungle_37 3f800000 ""
probe shop_jungle_38 3fc00000 "Too many people around! One mistake making dynamite, and... well, they'd HATE the outcome! Dwarves are naturally drawn to the Underground, it's in our blood! I love how well Moe the Tavernkeep can handle a container of fireball! I wanna strap Marquis the Arms Dealer to a rocket and watch what happens! "
probe shop_jungle_54 3fc00000 "Overcrowding is as overcrowding does. Seeing is believing, but sometimes the most likeable things are in the Underground. There's no greater joy than seen through the eyes of Tiara the Princess! Chanterelle the Truffle? I hadn't seen anything so delicious in my life. I can't quite place it, but I find McKinly the Tax Collector fascinating. For some reason, being around Hannah the Nurse makes me feel uneasy. "
probe shop_jungle_107 3f733333 "This crowding triggers bad memories of goblin war camps, I really hate it. Ahh, the Underground is a nice, quiet place to construct more gadgets. Major like-age! Marshanna the Mechanic makes my cardiac core function improperly, it appears I love how that feels! Danel the Dye Trader understands how fun it is to mix things together, I can respect that! "
probe shop_jungle_108 3fc00000 "This overcrowding is starting to dampen my magic! I think. I dislike the Ocean, magic does not flow well in a place like this. Humphrey the Merchant and I share a very long history, I like the mutual wisdom. That loathsome Lambda the Cyborg is a complete and total abomination to magic! "
probe shop_jungle_124 3fc00000 "I'm going to need a way bigger power source for THIS MANY people, I hate it! I don't like the Underground, it reminds me of a traumatic experience! Umm... Xanos the Goblin Tinkerer makes my heart flutter, I need to get that checked! I feel like I understand Lambda the Cyborg better than anyone else. I don't really like that Marquis the Arms Dealer won't leave me alone! "
probe shop_jungle_142 3fc00000 "This is a pretty big crowd, each and every one on the naughty list. I hate carrying that heavy bag of coal! "
probe shop_jungle_160 3fc00000 "I hate it. So many people... I... I'm not going to get eaten, right? I love Joe the Guide for being able to talk to me without mysteriously getting hungry. Elysia the Dryad treats me with respect, as though I'm a true part of nature. I don't know how to feel about that, except I like it. Herald the Clothier has tried to eat me so many times. I swear, one time they weren't even human! I, obviously, dislike it. Konah the Witch Doctor has tried to throw me into a pot filled with other unusual ingredients. I hate that. "
probe shop_jungle_178 3fc00000 "Oi, I absolutely hate crowded quarters! The shrubbery and mess of the Jungle really grinds my gears! I love how unique and interesting Lambda the Cyborg truly is, remarkable! Guido the Painter is a likeable sort who helps me spruce up my inventions. Lexus the Party Girl is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Leomund the Wizard is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Elysia the Dryad is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. "
probe shop_jungle_207 3fc00000 "When I'm not doing business, I'd much rather be alone, yes? I hate feeling crammed in! Marquis the Arms Dealer has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Guido the Painter has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Oh dear, that Selina the Steampunker has no sense of color or style, I don't like. I truly, truly hate how unsavory Red Beard the Pirate can be. "
probe shop_jungle_208 3fc00000 "Wow, there's so many people here, I hate that it's not for a party. Ew, it's so drab in the Underground. How can you party in a place like this? I love that Leomund the Wizard always dazzles at my parties. I totally like Stella the Stylist's party style. I think Humphrey the Merchant is a killjoy at parties. I hate how McKinly the Tax Collector always tries to shut down my after-parties. What a grump! "
probe shop_jungle_209 3fc00000 "Lifeform limit exceeded. Neural functions overloaded. Translation: I hate this. The flora and fauna are invading my synthetic exoskeleton: the Jungle is an undesired location for myself. Stella the Stylist attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Red Beard the Pirate attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Selina the Steampunker attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Leomund the Wizard's functions cannot be scientifically analyzed. Neural functions overloaded. Translation: I hate this. "
probe shop_jungle_227 3fc00000 "I hate noisy crowds, when will I get some peace and quiet? There are many ingredients for mixin' new paint in the Jungle, and the pretty view don't hurt either! I would really love to paint Elysia the Dryad... because of the vivid colors, of course! Lexus the Party Girl and I like the same shade of pink! That's a friend, in my book! Lambda the Cyborg is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. Chanterelle the Truffle is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. "
probe shop_jungle_228 3fc00000 "Too many of your kind are gathering too near, growing much malice in my soul. I cannot fathom existing elsewhere, the Jungle is the center of my voodoo spirits. Elysia the Dryad is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. Joe the Guide is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. I dislike the practices of Hannah the Nurse. True healing cannot come from metal and glass. Fury fills my being as abominations sprout from tainted earth - I speak of Chanterelle the Truffle. "
probe shop_jungle_229 3fc00000 "Ye too hate the feelin' that a mutiny be comin'? Too many scallywags gettin' close to me quarters. Hardy har har, matey, the Ocean is me true home! Yarr, Tiara the Princess'd fetch a hefty reward on the seas... jus' kidding, she's me favorite lass. Ahoy, me takes Bart the Angler under me wing, landlubber. Me love raisin' sea pups! Har Har! Melikes how Moe the Tavernkeep brings ye best bottle o' rum. Ye know me don't like that Stella the Stylist tries to cut me beard, I've slit scurvy throats fer less! Me want to make Joe the Guide walk ye plank, sea dog! Hate the coddlin' and the dastardly smell! "
probe shop_jungle_353 3fc00000 "I absolutely cannot stand having so many people living around me, I can't focus. It's nice, calm atmosphere for cutting hair in the Ocean. I can't even touch Tiara the Princess's hair, it's too perfect! Danel the Dye Trader is quite the looker... so exotic... I think I'm in love... Red Beard the Pirate is strong and mysterious. I like that. I tried to work on Moe the Tavernkeep, but was rudely rejected, I don't like stubborn people! "
probe shop_jungle_368 3f800000 ""
probe shop_jungle_369 3fc00000 "I hate all these strangers - they scared all my fish half to death! Why is the Ocean my favorite place to go? It has tons of cool fish, duh! Tiara the Princess is not a fish, yet she doesn't annoy me! That's really cool! Lexus the Party Girl actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! Tordak the Demolitionist actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! McKinly the Tax Collector actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! I hate Moe the Tavernkeep, and anyone else who treats me like a child! "
probe shop_jungle_441 3fc00000 "Go tell all these miserable poor freeloaders to scram, I hate crowds. Tiara the Princess shouldn't pay taxes, she's the princess... but she insisted. I highly admire Humphrey the Merchant. Anyone who knows the true value of money earns my utmost respect! Exuberant people tend to give me a headache, but somehow I actually like Lexus the Party Girl. I must be losing my mind! Tordak the Demolitionist is just too noisy, away with them and their ilk! "
probe shop_jungle_550 3fc00000 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate overcrowded quarters. Tiara the Princess would make a great ruler where I come from, as well. Tordak the Demolitionist is one crazy little drinker, I love it! I rather dislike Joe the Guide, they put out similar vibes as some of the dark things from Etheria. "
probe shop_jungle_588 3fbc28f6 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate all the foot traffic here. Tell me something. How am I supposed to golf in a place like the Underground? I tried to teach Tiara the Princess a few slick golf tricks, but she schooled me instead! I like her. It's always fun to hang out with Guido the Painter. Good people. Unpopular opinion: I quite love having Bart the Angler around. I get my water hazards returned to me! I dislike being around Red Beard the Pirate. Makes me feel uneasy. It's always fun to hang out with Lizzy the Zoologist. Good people. "
probe shop_jungle_633 3f9c28f6 "Eek! I hate feeling worried about what will happen with all these people around! Like, Tiara the Princess has her subjects searching for a way for me to break my fox curse! Yass! I don't like how cruel Bart the Angler is! I can't explain it. I have like, a thing for Konah the Witch Doctor. Is it because of the tail? Of course I like Lion Pines the Golfer! I like, knew them since I was born! "
probe shop_jungle_663 3f400000 "I LOVE being surrounded by others, but I wish not to see them so unhappy with overcrowding. Moe the Tavernkeep is from an entirely different world, that's so interesting! Lizzy the Zoologist always lets me play with her pets, its so nice! McKinly the Tax Collector is terribly misunderstood, he's very kind to me! "
state shop_jungle rand 16 64ad86cedeb95b04 player 459a7000,45a8e000,00000000,40000000,100,20 npc 27:f418ac70a6e34ea4 proj 0:cbf29ce484222325
probe shop_snow_17 3fc00000 "I hate how many people hang around, but none of them buy anything! Lorraine the Nurse makes loads of money, I like deep pockets. I dislike Herbert the Tax Collector, too frugal and doesn't ever buy my things. I hate Tyler the Angler's terrible personality! "
probe shop_snow_18 3fc00000 "UGH, I hate how unhealthy it is to cram so many people in one place! Eww, I don't like the Snow's propensity for illness. What? Terrell the Arms Dealer? I don't have a crush! I don't! Shut up! Leomund the Wizard is a smart and likeable goof. I don't like Destiny the Party Girl that much, kinda weirds me out. I don't like Calista the Dryad that much, kinda weirds me out. "
probe shop_snow_19 3fc00000 "Hey, I can't do what I do with so many people watchin' me. Yeah, no, the Snow makes me very uncomfortable. Think Lorraine the Nurse ever, ya know, checks me out? Yeah, I like Cynthia the Steampunker, wicked cool person. I don't really like Billy Bones the Golfer bein' on my turf, ya know? I'd REALLY like to use Dolbere the Demolitionist as a range target sometime. "
probe shop_snow_20 3fc00000 "So many others crammed into one spot? The grass is doomed, I hate it! I like that Opuni the Witch Doctor resonates with every fiber of my being! I like that Enoki the Truffle resonates with every fiber of my being! I don't like that Tyler the Angler has no respect for other beings. I hate Billy Bones the Golfer's destructive habits towards nature! "
probe shop_snow_22 3fc00000 "I hate overcrowding. I prefer the open world! I'm quite fond of Rupert the Clothier, we have a lot in common. Cynthia the Steampunker rubs me the wrong way. Maybe it's the weird clothing? I hate that Marco the Painter is around. The world is fine the way it was made! I'm quite fond of Dian the Zoologist, we have a lot in common. "
probe shop_snow_37 3f800000 ""
probe shop_snow_38 3fc00000 "Too many people around! One mistake making dynamite, and... well, they'd HATE the outcome! I love how well Dani Moo the Tavernkeep can handle a container of fireball! I wanna strap Terrell the Arms Dealer to a rocket and watch what happens! "
probe shop_snow_54 3fc00000 "Overcrowding is as overcrowding does. There's no greater joy than seen through the eyes of Emilia the Princess! Enoki the Truffle? I hadn't seen anything so delicious in my life. I can't quite place it, but I find Herbert the Tax Collector fascinating. For some reason, being around Lorraine the Nurse makes me feel uneasy. "
probe shop_snow_107 3f8147ae "This crowding triggers bad memories of goblin war camps, I really hate it. Meredith the Mechanic makes my cardiac core function improperly, it appears I love how that feels! Hanno the Dye Trader understands how fun it is to mix things together, I can respect that! "
probe shop_snow_108 3fbd70a4 "This overcrowding is starting to dampen my magic! I think. Edmund the Merchant and I share a very long history, I like the mutual wisdom. That loathsome Beta the Cyborg is a complete and total abomination to magic! "
probe shop_snow_124 3fb47ae1 "I'm going to need a way bigger power source for THIS MANY people, I hate it! I like the Snow, machines don't overheat here, and the energy flow is efficient. Umm... Xanos the Goblin Tinkerer makes my heart flutter, I need to get that checked! I feel like I understand Beta the Cyborg better than anyone else. I don't really like that Terrell the Arms Dealer won't leave me alone! "
