probe shop_mushroom_17 3fc00000 "I hate how many people hang around, but none of them buy anything! Hmm, the Desert is a terrible place for business, I don't like it. Hannah the Nurse makes loads of money, I like deep pockets. I dislike Agnew the Tax Collector, too frugal and doesn't ever buy my things. I hate Charles the Angler's terrible personality! "
probe shop_mushroom_18 3fc00000 "UGH, I hate how unhealthy it is to cram so many people in one place! What? Terrell the Arms Dealer? I don't have a crush! I don't! Shut up! Gearroid the Wizard is a smart and likeable goof. I don't like Trixy the Party Girl that much, kinda weirds me out. I don't like Nata the Dryad that much, kinda weirds me out. "
probe shop_mushroom_19 3fc00000 "Hey, I can't do what I do with so many people watchin' me. Ya know, the Desert is secluded and great for business, if you catch my drift. Think Hannah the Nurse ever, ya know, checks me out? Yeah, I like Zylphia the Steampunker, wicked cool person. I don't really like Billy Bones the Golfer bein' on my turf, ya know? I'd REALLY like to use Fikod the Demolitionist as a range target sometime. "
probe shop_mushroom_20 3fc00000 "So many others crammed into one spot? The grass is doomed, I hate it! I rather dislike how the Desert is so devoid of life. I like that Gboto the Witch Doctor resonates with every fiber of my being! I like that Enoki the Truffle resonates with every fiber of my being! I don't like that Charles the Angler has no respect for other beings. I hate Billy Bones the Golfer's destructive habits towards nature! "
probe shop_mushroom_22 3fc00000 "I hate overcrowding. I prefer the open world! I'm quite fond of Lincoln the Clothier, we have a lot in common. Zylphia the Steampunker rubs me the wrong way. Maybe it's the weird clothing? I hate that Leonardo the Painter is around. The world is fine the way it was made! I'm quite fond of Lori the Zoologist, we have a lot in common. "
probe shop_mushroom_37 3f800000 ""
probe shop_mushroom_38 3fc00000 "Too many people around! One mistake making dynamite, and... well, they'd HATE the outcome! Dwarves are naturally drawn to the Underground, it's in our blood! I love how well Jerry the Tavernkeep can handle a container of fireball! I wanna strap Terrell the Arms Dealer to a rocket and watch what happens! "
probe shop_mushroom_54 3fc00000 "Overcrowding is as overcrowding does. Seeing is believing, but sometimes the most likeable things are in the Underground. There's no greater joy than seen through the eyes of Belle the Princess! Enoki the Truffle? I hadn't seen anything so delicious in my life. I can't quite place it, but I find Agnew the Tax Collector fascinating. For some reason, being around Hannah the Nurse makes me feel uneasy. "
probe shop_mushroom_107 3f733333 "This crowding triggers bad memories of goblin war camps, I really hate it. Ahh, the Underground is a nice, quiet place to construct more gadgets. Major like-age! Meredith the Mechanic makes my cardiac core function improperly, it appears I love how that feels! Abdosir the Dye Trader understands how fun it is to mix things together, I can respect that! "
probe shop_mushroom_108 3fbd70a4 "This overcrowding is starting to dampen my magic! I think. Wilbur the Merchant and I share a very long history, I like the mutual wisdom. That loathsome Lambda the Cyborg is a complete and total abomination to magic! "
probe shop_mushroom_124 3fc00000 "I'm going to need a way bigger power source for THIS MANY people, I hate it! I don't like the Underground, it reminds me of a traumatic experience! Umm... Xon the Goblin Tinkerer makes my heart flutter, I need to get that checked! I feel like I understand Lambda the Cyborg better than anyone else. I don't really like that Terrell the Arms Dealer won't leave me alone! "
probe shop_mushroom_142 3fc00000 "This is a pretty big crowd, each and every one on the naughty list. I hate carrying that heavy bag of coal! I'm adding you to the naughty list for putting me in a awful place like the Desert. "
probe shop_mushroom_160 3fc00000 "I hate it. So many people... I... I'm not going to get eaten, right? I love Brandon the Guide for being able to talk to me without mysteriously getting hungry. Nata the Dryad treats me with respect, as though I'm a true part of nature. I don't know how to feel about that, except I like it. Lincoln the Clothier has tried to eat me so many times. I swear, one time they weren't even human! I, obviously, dislike it. Gboto the Witch Doctor has tried to throw me into a pot filled with other unusual ingredients. I hate that. "
probe shop_mushroom_178 3fc00000 "Oi, I absolutely hate crowded quarters! I prefer the wide open spaces here in the Desert, great for jetpack joyrides! I love how unique and interesting Lambda the Cyborg truly is, remarkable! Leonardo the Painter is a likeable sort who helps me spruce up my inventions. Trixy the Party Girl is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Gearroid the Wizard is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Nata the Dryad is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. "
probe shop_mushroom_207 3fc00000 "When I'm not doing business, I'd much rather be alone, yes? I hate feeling crammed in! Ahh, the Desert is really nice, reminds me of my home town, I like it very much so! Terrell the Arms Dealer has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Leonardo the Painter has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Oh dear, that Zylphia the Steampunker has no sense of color or style, I don't like. I truly, truly hate how unsavory Captain Bullywort the Pirate can be. "
probe shop_mushroom_208 3fc00000 "Wow, there's so many people here, I hate that it's not for a party. Ew, it's so drab in the Underground. How can you party in a place like this? I love that Gearroid the Wizard always dazzles at my parties. I totally like Petra the Stylist's party style. I think Wilbur the Merchant is a killjoy at parties. I hate how Agnew the Tax Collector always tries to shut down my after-parties. What a grump! "
probe shop_mushroom_209 3fc00000 "Lifeform limit exceeded. Neural functions overloaded. Translation: I hate this. Petra the Stylist attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Captain Bullywort the Pirate attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Zylphia the Steampunker attempts to treat me favorably like another human. It appears I appreciate that. Gearroid the Wizard's functions cannot be scientifically analyzed. Neural functions overloaded. Translation: I hate this. "
probe shop_mushroom_227 3fc00000 "I hate noisy crowds, when will I get some peace and quiet? I would really love to paint Nata the Dryad... because of the vivid colors, of course! Trixy the Party Girl and I like the same shade of pink! That's a friend, in my book! Lambda the Cyborg is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. Enoki the Truffle is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. "
probe shop_mushroom_228 3fc00000 "Too many of your kind are gathering too near, growing much malice in my soul. Nata the Dryad is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. Brandon the Guide is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. I dislike the practices of Hannah the Nurse. True healing cannot come from metal and glass. Fury fills my being as abominations sprout from tainted earth - I speak of Enoki the Truffle. "
probe shop_mushroom_229 3fc00000 "Ye too hate the feelin' that a mutiny be comin'? Too many scallywags gettin' close to me quarters. Argh, the Underground be a bit cramped for me style, ye scurvy dog! Yarr, Belle the Princess'd fetch a hefty reward on the seas... jus' kidding, she's me favorite lass. Ahoy, me takes Charles the Angler under me wing, landlubber. Me love raisin' sea pups! Har Har! Melikes how Jerry the Tavernkeep brings ye best bottle o' rum. Ye know me don't like that Petra the Stylist tries to cut me beard, I've slit scurvy throats fer less! Me want to make Brandon the Guide walk ye plank, sea dog! Hate the coddlin' and the dastardly smell! "
probe shop_mushroom_353 3fc00000 "I absolutely cannot stand having so many people living around me, I can't focus. I can't even touch Belle the Princess's hair, it's too perfect! Abdosir the Dye Trader is quite the looker... so exotic... I think I'm in love... Captain Bullywort the Pirate is strong and mysterious. I like that. I tried to work on Jerry the Tavernkeep, but was rudely rejected, I don't like stubborn people! "
probe shop_mushroom_368 3f800000 ""
probe shop_mushroom_369 3fc00000 "I hate all these strangers - they scared all my fish half to death! Did you hit your head? Duh, the Desert doesn't have fish! Belle the Princess is not a fish, yet she doesn't annoy me! That's really cool! Trixy the Party Girl actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! Fikod the Demolitionist actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! Agnew the Tax Collector actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! I hate Jerry the Tavernkeep, and anyone else who treats me like a child! "
probe shop_mushroom_441 3fc00000 "Go tell all these miserable poor freeloaders to scram, I hate crowds. Belle the Princess shouldn't pay taxes, she's the princess... but she insisted. I highly admire Wilbur the Merchant. Anyone who knows the true value of money earns my utmost respect! Exuberant people tend to give me a headache, but somehow I actually like Trixy the Party Girl. I must be losing my mind! Fikod the Demolitionist is just too noisy, away with them and their ilk! "
probe shop_mushroom_550 3fc00000 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate overcrowded quarters. Belle the Princess would make a great ruler where I come from, as well. Fikod the Demolitionist is one crazy little drinker, I love it! I rather dislike Brandon the Guide, they put out similar vibes as some of the dark things from Etheria. "
probe shop_mushroom_588 3fbc28f6 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate all the foot traffic here. Tell me something. How am I supposed to golf in a place like the Underground? I tried to teach Belle the Princess a few slick golf tricks, but she schooled me instead! I like her. It's always fun to hang out with Leonardo the Painter. Good people. Unpopular opinion: I quite love having Charles the Angler around. I get my water hazards returned to me! I dislike being around Captain Bullywort the Pirate. Makes me feel uneasy. It's always fun to hang out with Lori the Zoologist. Good people. "
probe shop_mushroom_633 3fa51eb8 "Eek! I hate feeling worried about what will happen with all these people around! It's like, weird having instincts and all, and the Desert really makes me want to run away! Like, Belle the Princess has her subjects searching for a way for me to break my fox curse! Yass! I don't like how cruel Charles the Angler is! I can't explain it. I have like, a thing for Gboto the Witch Doctor. Is it because of the tail? Of course I like Billy Bones the Golfer! I like, knew them since I was born! "
probe shop_mushroom_663 3f400000 "I LOVE being surrounded by others, but I wish not to see them so unhappy with overcrowding. Charles the Angler is such a nice boy, always offering to take me fishing! Jerry the Tavernkeep is from an entirely different world, that's so interesting! Billy Bones the Golfer's passion for golf inspires me! "
