probe shop_temple_227 3fc00000 "I hate noisy crowds, when will I get some peace and quiet? There are many ingredients for mixin' new paint in the Jungle, and the pretty view don't hurt either! I would really love to paint Faye the Dryad... because of the vivid colors, of course! Sugar the Party Girl and I like the same shade of pink! That's a friend, in my book! Zeta the Cyborg is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. Chanterelle the Truffle is just too bland for my tastes, I dislike associating with dull types. "
probe shop_temple_228 3fc00000 "Too many of your kind are gathering too near, growing much malice in my soul. I cannot fathom existing elsewhere, the Jungle is the center of my voodoo spirits. Faye the Dryad is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. Asher the Guide is a kindred spirit of nature, my soul is at peace in their presence. I dislike the practices of Hannah the Nurse. True healing cannot come from metal and glass. Fury fills my being as abominations sprout from tainted earth - I speak of Chanterelle the Truffle. "
probe shop_temple_229 3fc00000 "Ye too hate the feelin' that a mutiny be comin'? Too many scallywags gettin' close to me quarters. Argh, the Underground be a bit cramped for me style, ye scurvy dog! Yarr, Momo the Princess'd fetch a hefty reward on the seas... jus' kidding, she's me favorite lass. Ahoy, me takes Bart the Angler under me wing, landlubber. Me love raisin' sea pups! Har Har! Melikes how Blacksmith the Tavernkeep brings ye best bottle o' rum. Ye know me don't like that Biah the Stylist tries to cut me beard, I've slit scurvy throats fer less! Me want to make Asher the Guide walk ye plank, sea dog! Hate the coddlin' and the dastardly smell! "
probe shop_temple_353 3fc00000 "I absolutely cannot stand having so many people living around me, I can't focus. I can't even touch Momo the Princess's hair, it's too perfect! Danel the Dye Trader is quite the looker... so exotic... I think I'm in love... Black Beard the Pirate is strong and mysterious. I like that. I tried to work on Blacksmith the Tavernkeep, but was rudely rejected, I don't like stubborn people! "
probe shop_temple_368 3f800000 ""
probe shop_temple_369 3fc00000 "I hate all these strangers - they scared all my fish half to death! Momo the Princess is not a fish, yet she doesn't annoy me! That's really cool! Sugar the Party Girl actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! Boften the Demolitionist actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! Blanton the Tax Collector actually knows what they're doing, unlike some OTHER people! I kinda like that! I hate Blacksmith the Tavernkeep, and anyone else who treats me like a child! "
probe shop_temple_441 3fc00000 "Go tell all these miserable poor freeloaders to scram, I hate crowds. Momo the Princess shouldn't pay taxes, she's the princess... but she insisted. I highly admire Alfred the Merchant. Anyone who knows the true value of money earns my utmost respect! Exuberant people tend to give me a headache, but somehow I actually like Sugar the Party Girl. I must be losing my mind! Boften the Demolitionist is just too noisy, away with them and their ilk! "
probe shop_temple_550 3fc00000 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate overcrowded quarters. Momo the Princess would make a great ruler where I come from, as well. Boften the Demolitionist is one crazy little drinker, I love it! I rather dislike Asher the Guide, they put out similar vibes as some of the dark things from Etheria. "
probe shop_temple_588 3fbc28f6 "Hate to say it, but I rather hate all the foot traffic here. Tell me something. How am I supposed to golf in a place like the Underground? I tried to teach Momo the Princess a few slick golf tricks, but she schooled me instead! I like her. It's always fun to hang out with Luciano the Painter. Good people. Unpopular opinion: I quite love having Bart the Angler around. I get my water hazards returned to me! I dislike being around Black Beard the Pirate. Makes me feel uneasy. It's always fun to hang out with Lilith the Zoologist. Good people. "
probe shop_temple_633 3f9c28f6 "Eek! I hate feeling worried about what will happen with all these people around! Like, Momo the Princess has her subjects searching for a way for me to break my fox curse! Yass! I don't like how cruel Bart the Angler is! I can't explain it. I have like, a thing for Kogi-ghi the Witch Doctor. Is it because of the tail? Of course I like William the Golfer! I like, knew them since I was born! "
probe shop_temple_663 3f400000 "I LOVE being surrounded by others, but I wish not to see them so unhappy with overcrowding. Bart the Angler is such a nice boy, always offering to take me fishing! Blanton the Tax Collector is terribly misunderstood, he's very kind to me! Biah the Stylist has the best hair advice, she's great to talk to! "
state shop_temple rand 15 4010b16ef796ee79 player 46457800,46033000,00000000,40000000,100,20 npc 27:1968da92e5cbab49 proj 0:cbf29ce484222325
probe shop_marble_17 3fc00000 "I hate how many people hang around, but none of them buy anything! Helen the Nurse makes loads of money, I like deep pockets. I dislike Dwyer the Tax Collector, too frugal and doesn't ever buy my things. I hate Jey the Angler's terrible personality! "
probe shop_marble_18 3fc00000 "UGH, I hate how unhealthy it is to cram so many people in one place! What? Malik the Arms Dealer? I don't have a crush! I don't! Shut up! Tagar the Wizard is a smart and likeable goof. I don't like Isis the Party Girl that much, kinda weirds me out. I don't like Xylia the Dryad that much, kinda weirds me out. "
probe shop_marble_19 3fc00000 "Hey, I can't do what I do with so many people watchin' me. Think Helen the Nurse ever, ya know, checks me out? Yeah, I like Leila the Steampunker, wicked cool person. I don't really like Jake Nicklelisp the Golfer bein' on my turf, ya know? I'd REALLY like to use Bazdin the Demolitionist as a range target sometime. "
probe shop_marble_20 3fc00000 "So many others crammed into one spot? The grass is doomed, I hate it! I kissed a tree in the Jungle and I liked it. I like that Abibe the Witch Doctor resonates with every fiber of my being! I like that Porcini the Truffle resonates with every fiber of my being! I don't like that Jey the Angler has no respect for other beings. I hate Jake Nicklelisp the Golfer's destructive habits towards nature! "
probe shop_marble_22 3fc00000 "I hate overcrowding. I prefer the open world! I'm quite fond of Alfred the Clothier, we have a lot in common. Leila the Steampunker rubs me the wrong way. Maybe it's the weird clothing? I hate that Raphael the Painter is around. The world is fine the way it was made! I'm quite fond of Maria the Zoologist, we have a lot in common. "
probe shop_marble_37 3f800000 ""
probe shop_marble_38 3fc00000 "Too many people around! One mistake making dynamite, and... well, they'd HATE the outcome! Dwarves are naturally drawn to the Underground, it's in our blood! I love how well Dale the Tavernkeep can handle a container of fireball! I wanna strap Malik the Arms Dealer to a rocket and watch what happens! "
probe shop_marble_54 3fc00000 "Overcrowding is as overcrowding does. Seeing is believing, but sometimes the most likeable things are in the Underground. There's no greater joy than seen through the eyes of Charlotte the Princess! Porcini the Truffle? I hadn't seen anything so delicious in my life. I can't quite place it, but I find Dwyer the Tax Collector fascinating. For some reason, being around Helen the Nurse makes me feel uneasy. "
probe shop_marble_107 3f733333 "This crowding triggers bad memories of goblin war camps, I really hate it. Ahh, the Underground is a nice, quiet place to construct more gadgets. Major like-age! Shirlena the Mechanic makes my cardiac core function improperly, it appears I love how that feels! Batnoam the Dye Trader understands how fun it is to mix things together, I can respect that! "
probe shop_marble_108 3fbd70a4 "This overcrowding is starting to dampen my magic! I think. Joseph the Merchant and I share a very long history, I like the mutual wisdom. That loathsome Alpha the Cyborg is a complete and total abomination to magic! "
probe shop_marble_124 3fc00000 "I'm going to need a way bigger power source for THIS MANY people, I hate it! I don't like the Underground, it reminds me of a traumatic experience! Umm... Negurk the Goblin Tinkerer makes my heart flutter, I need to get that checked! I feel like I understand Alpha the Cyborg better than anyone else. I don't really like that Malik the Arms Dealer won't leave me alone! "
probe shop_marble_142 3fc00000 "This is a pretty big crowd, each and every one on the naughty list. I hate carrying that heavy bag of coal! "
probe shop_marble_160 3fc00000 "I hate it. So many people... I... I'm not going to get eaten, right? I love Jeff the Guide for being able to talk to me without mysteriously getting hungry. Xylia the Dryad treats me with respect, as though I'm a true part of nature. I don't know how to feel about that, except I like it. Alfred the Clothier has tried to eat me so many times. I swear, one time they weren't even human! I, obviously, dislike it. Abibe the Witch Doctor has tried to throw me into a pot filled with other unusual ingredients. I hate that. "
probe shop_marble_178 3fc00000 "Oi, I absolutely hate crowded quarters! The shrubbery and mess of the Jungle really grinds my gears! I love how unique and interesting Alpha the Cyborg truly is, remarkable! Raphael the Painter is a likeable sort who helps me spruce up my inventions. Isis the Party Girl is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Tagar the Wizard is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. Xylia the Dryad is too otherworldly! I dinnae like them much. "
probe shop_marble_207 3fc00000 "When I'm not doing business, I'd much rather be alone, yes? I hate feeling crammed in! Malik the Arms Dealer has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Raphael the Painter has good eyes for vividness and business, I like it, yes? Oh dear, that Leila the Steampunker has no sense of color or style, I don't like. I truly, truly hate how unsavory James T. Beard the Pirate can be. "
probe shop_marble_208 3fc00000 "Wow, there's so many people here, I hate that it's not for a party. Ew, it's so drab in the Underground. How can you party in a place like this? I love that Tagar the Wizard always dazzles at my parties. I totally like Flora the Stylist's party style. I think Joseph the Merchant is a killjoy at parties. I hate how Dwyer the Tax Collector always tries to shut down my after-parties. What a grump! "
